codex
Fault delivery is available: the two branches in `memory_rw.c` are MIPS and m88k. Faulting would still be the wrong disposition for valid NVRAM.

Clock writes are also observable: the model stores them and returns them until the next READ-bit rising edge overwrites the seven time bytes from the host. A detector that checks only survival would miss a repair that bypasses termination but drops writes.

